      "text": "Maintaining Your Wave Music System\n• Adjust the internal antenna by rotating the unit slightly one way and then the other. • Move the unit farther from a TV, refrigerator, fluorescent lamps, halogen lamps, dimmer switches, or other electronic equipment that generates electrical noise. • If neither suggestion works, you may be in an area of weak AM signal coverage.",
