      "text": "Your Wave® music system is easily operated using the remote control. Just aim the remote at the front panel and press the buttons. The remote normally works within 20 feet of the front panel.\nThroughout this owner’s guide you will see button icons to the left of the operating instruc- tions. These icons refer to buttons located on the remote control.",
